{"title": "Push: add at the end, sift up", "view": "tree", "steps": [{"nodes": [{"id": "n0", "label": "2", "parent": null}, {"id": "n1", "label": "5", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n3", "label": "8", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n4", "label": "9", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n2", "label": "3", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n5", "label": "6", "parent": "n2"}, {"id": "n2-right", "label": "", "parent": "n2", "hidden": true}], "highlight": [], "vars": {"array": [2, 5, 3, 8, 9, 6]}, "caption": "A min-heap: every parent \u2264 its children, so the minimum is at the root. It's stored in an array: children of i are 2i+1 and 2i+2."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "n0", "label": "2", "parent": null}, {"id": "n1", "label": "5", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n3", "label": "8", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n4", "label": "9", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n2", "label": "3", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n5", "label": "6", "parent": "n2"}, {"id": "n6", "label": "1", "parent": "n2"}], "active": "n6", "vars": {"array": [2, 5, 3, 8, 9, 6, 1]}, "caption": "push(1): put it at the next free slot (the end of the array), keeping the tree complete."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "n0", "label": "2", "parent": null}, {"id": "n1", "label": "5", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n3", "label": "8", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n4", "label": "9", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n2", "label": "1", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n5", "label": "6", "parent": "n2"}, {"id": "n6", "label": "3", "parent": "n2"}], "active": "n2", "vars": {"array": [2, 5, 1, 8, 9, 6, 3]}, "caption": "1 < its parent 3: swap them (sift up). Parent of index 6 is (6 \u2212 1) // 2 = 2."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "n0", "label": "1", "parent": null}, {"id": "n1", "label": "5", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n3", "label": "8", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n4", "label": "9", "parent": "n1"}, {"id": "n2", "label": "2", "parent": "n0"}, {"id": "n5", "label": "6", "parent": "n2"}, {"id": "n6", "label": "3", "parent": "n2"}], "active": "n0", "vars": {"array": [1, 5, 2, 8, 9, 6, 3]}, "caption": "1 < its parent 2: swap them (sift up